See also: CHANNELS, CONSENT, MAGIC (summon).$help$,
      min_level = 0,
      category = 'guide',
      usage = 'follow {name} | invite {player} | group | gsay {message} | split {copper}',
      source_file = 'data/help/groups.md',
      updated_at = now()
    WHERE id = v_id
      AND (keywords, title, content, min_level, category, usage, source_file)
          IS DISTINCT FROM (ARRAY['group', 'groups', 'grouping', 'party', 'invite']::text[], 'Groups', $help$Adventuring together is safer and shares the rewards. Following someone only
